  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Continuing HIV Services</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity seeks to address remaining challenges and close persistent gaps to achieve the UNSAIDS 95-95-95 goals and therefore reach and sustain HIV/AIDS epidemic control in burundi. it will set up interventions to strengthen the health system and to improve community engagement, building on best practices from other pepfar activities implemented to date. The activity will complement existing USAID/Burundi clinical, community health, and social-behavior services delivery activities.</narrative>
  </description>
